## Scope — what this licence does and does not cover

This MIT licence covers **the contents of this repository**: the JavaScript and
Python SDKs, the example projects, the OpenAPI document, and the documentation.
Use them freely, including commercially.

It does **not** licence the hosted AmberOne API service itself. Access to the
service is governed by the commercial terms at https://amberoneai.com/terms and
by the plan you subscribe to. Nothing here grants a right to use the service
beyond those terms, and nothing there restricts your use of the client code
above.

The distinction matters in practice: you may fork this SDK, vendor it, or ship
it inside a closed-source product. You may not resell access to the API itself
without a separate agreement.
